DESCRIPTION:Venue: Revolver\nTags: post-punk\, goth\, shoegaze\n\nBoylotion
 : \n\nBoylotion krabber frem fra Bergens regntunge smug og allmenninger fo
 r å servere en kald cocktail av post punk\, goth og shoegaze. Med glitren
 de gitarer\, melodisk bass og drivende trommemaskin står bandet med en fo
 t plantet tidlig på 80-tallet\, mens den andre strekker seg mot fremtiden
 . Vokalist Isak Meland topper lydbildet med mørk og lengtende jamring om 
 kjærlighet\, frykt og underkastelse. Etter konsert på VillVillVest\, opp
 varming for Kristi Brud og gode anmeldelser på debuttsingelen “End Thin
 gs” gleder Boylotion seg til å ta fatt på Oslo! “Få det på krukke\
 , tube\, EP eller album ASAP” - BT\, 7.9.24\n\nPlastik Noir: \n\nEmergin
 g from the mist-laden city of Bergen\, Norway\, Plastik Noir is a Dark Wav
 e duo born in October 2024. Enshrouded in shadow and bound by a deep\, per
 sonal connection\, the pair found solace and inspiration in the melancholi
 c beauty of dark music. Their shared love both for each other and for the 
 haunting soundscapes that define their genre\, ignited a creative flame th
 at could not be ignored. Plastik Noir crafts music that evokes the twiligh
 t between dream and nightmare. Their sound is a spectral fusion of etherea
 l synths\, bone-dry basslines\, and pulsating\, danceable beats\, all crow
 ned by vocals that echo with longing and spectral melancholy. Each track i
 s a descent into emotional depths\, a dance with darkness\, and an ode to 
 the beauty found in sorrow. Their music is not merely heard\, it is felt\,
  like a whispered secret in the dead of night.\n\nTickets: https://revolve
 roslo.ticketco.events/no/nb/e/boylotion__plastik_noir__dj_batplanet__revol
 ver\n
LOCATION:Revolver
SUMMARY:Boylotion // Plastik Noir // DJ: BatPlanet // Revolver
X-WR-CALNAME:oslogigguide
X-WR-TIMEZONE:Europe/Oslo
X-PUBLISHED-TTL:PT24H
END:VEVENT
